@title The wire tool names the pin it would connect to (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Polish: a small label beside the snap ring says what the next click connects to (device tag and pin name), shown at once, no animation. Light look included. Positions are for this window size (the view zooms when the Light look is picked, so the last move differs); the drawn text cannot be read by the harness, so the pictures are the evidence.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
text coil
key Return
click 600 300
wait 10
key Escape
click_text Connect
wait 6
move 425 358
wait 6
shot pin-label-dark
move 425 328
wait 6
shot pin-label-top-pin
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
click_text Connect
wait 6
move 702 413
wait 6
shot pin-label-light
check_layout
